      text: Gateway 无下单、改单、撤单或解锁方法；写操作需独立确认
  - elementId: note5-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [530, 372, 366, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      bold: true
      text: 可复算
  - elementId: note5-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [530, 390, 366, 28]
    content:
      style: "$cap"
      text: 同一冻结输入连续运行结果一致；数字可回到引擎输入与快照
  - elementId: takeaway-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [64, 438, 832, 1]
    viewBox: [832, 1]
